    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うふふ、うふふふ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mhmm... Ahaha!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;……ずいぶんとご機嫌だね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;... You seem...unusually cheerful?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だって、楽しいんだもん。
いろんなコスチューム着られて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, it's fun! There's so
many costumes to wear!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>女の子だもんね。やっぱたくさん服があって
いろいろ試すのって楽しいよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ohh, true! Every girl loves a chance
to try on some new clothes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん、『なりきり士』って楽しいよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right? Being a Roleplayer is fun!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47376</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんで着替えんのがそんな楽しいんだ？
めんどくせーってば</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How's it fun just to put some clothes
on? Changing'em so much is a pain.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47516</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まったくこれだからこのハゲぼうずは……
いいか、着替えっつーのも男のロマンなんだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fool brat, what's not to understand!? Listen
up: a real man loves a changin' of clothes!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47612</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何言ってんだ？
んなもん、さっぱりわかんねよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What're you talking about?
I don't get that stuff at all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47764</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>考えてもみるだ……うら若き乙女のお着替えシーン。
かすかに聞こえる布ずれの音……そして息遣い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Try and picture it... A young girl's changin'. Ya
can hear the rustlin' of cloth, and her breathin'...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>間違ってうっかり着替えを除いてしまい
きゃー、エッチ！　のお約束イベント……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya've accidentally stumbled in on her, and she
shouts, "Ew! Pervert!" In keepin' with tradition...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48044</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わかるか、わかるだか！　こーんな感じで、
お着替えには、いーっぱい男の夢が詰まってるだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, do ya understand me yet? Every man dreams
that one day, he'll experience it for himself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48124</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>家具のくせにおっさんくせっ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I never thought a piece of furniture
could be a creepy old man.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48184</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_169_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まったく……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sheesh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
